+        "circuits.  Circuit i is (sum_j linear[j]*x_j)^r + constant over "
+        "GF(p), has linear[i]=1 and linear[j]=0 for j>i, and for i>0 its "
+        "strict-lower coefficients equal one scalar a_i times the public "
