codex
The final bare evidence is valid under the repository harness, with an important caveat I’ll state prominently: two shipping calls returned explicit but invalid circuits, while the third returned an empty provider response that the script scores as unsolved. The hard instance is also very large (about 10,000 point rows), so input attention/context is part of the measured gap. I’m writing the README with those limitations, the paper’s withdrawal, the 21-call ladder, and the exact construction/verification argument.
